    "baseRefName": "staging",
    "body": "## Summary\nPerform-once Type I control evidence, actually conducted this quarter, plus supporting artifacts and SHA-pinned Actions. Highlights: a REAL backup restore drill (restored the 2026-07-29 Firestore backup to a temp DB, verified, cleaned up — A1.3), an access review from live GitHub/GCP IAM (least privilege confirmed), vendor SOC 2 review memos (GCP/GitHub/LLM), management + risk review, an IR tabletop walkthrough, and a readiness self-assessment. Adds disclosure log, endpoint/disposal/asset inventories, DSAR runbook, vendor-register PI/breach columns, and people-evidence scaffolds (owner completes/signs — not fabricated). Actions pinned to commit SHAs.\n\n## Tickets\n| Ticket | Title | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| #33 | Evidence pack 2026-Q3 + SHA-pin | In Progress |\n\n## Changes\n- .github/workflows/compliance.yml\n- .github/workflows/daily-verify.yml\n- .github/workflows/dependency-review.yml\n- .github/workflows/drill.yml\n- .github/workflows/post-merge-archive.yml\n- .github/workflows/quarterly-rituals.yml\n- .github/workflows/review.yml\n- .github/workflows/shadow-agent.yml\n- assets.md\n- compliance/disclosure-log.md\n- evidence/access-reviews/2026-Q3.md\n- evidence/ir-exercises/2026-tabletop.md\n- evidence/oversight/2026-Q3.md\n- evidence/people/README.md\n- evidence/people/background-check-2026.md\n- evidence/people/policy-acknowledgment-2026.md\n- evidence/people/security-training-2026.md\n- evidence/restore-tests/2026-Q3.md\n- evidence/risk-reviews/2026-Q3.md\n- evidence/self-assessment-2026.md\n- evidence/vendors/gcp-review-2026.md\n- evidence/vendors/github-review-2026.md\n- evidence/vendors/llm-review-2026.md\n- inventory/disposals.yaml\n- inventory/endpoints.yaml\n- policies/vendor-register.md\n- runbooks/dsar.md\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] Restore drill actually executed via gcloud (restore → verify → delete temp DB); recorded in evidence/restore-tests/2026-Q3.md\n- [x] Access review enumerated from live gh + gcloud IAM (no fabrication)\n- [x] Docs/YAML/workflow only — no source files; SHA-pinned actions resolve to the same v4/v2 releases\n- [x] People-evidence files are clearly-marked templates awaiting the owner's real sign-off",
